iruses that just gave us a sniffle earlier are now battering the best of us. No need to panic, but good to be cautious.","in_corpus":false,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":2,"dt_root_h":2.017,"parent_id":"1876147567911674168","conversation_id":"1876147567911674168"},{"id":"1876181418793140476","x":0.04214,"y":9.0,"t":1736151482,"iso":"2025-01-06T08:18:02.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":2,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"FoolzWizdom","author_id":"346642258","text":"@W01fGirl True. Post Covid we do see a surge in frequent, mostly self limiting viral infections. Abundance in caution but no cause for panic.","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":2.242,"parent_id":"1876178022338019382","conversation_id":"1876147567911674168"},{"id":"1876174622196158663","x":0.033682,"y":8.0,"t":1736149862,"iso":"2025-01-06T07:51:02Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"quote","niveau":1,"author":"rajscd","author_id":"51707461","text":"No need to panic like #stockmarketcrash happening today. #HMPV is not a new virus and definitely not the chinese variant which infected two children in Bengaluru. https://t.co/yRZ9eAds1E","in_corpus":true,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":1.792,"parent_id":"1876147567911674168","conversation_id":"1876174622196158663"},{"id":"1876173941754179729","x":0.032831,"y":6.5,"t":1736149699,"iso":"2025-01-06T07:48:19.000Z","rt":0,"replies":2,"quotes":2,"likes":5,"relation":"reply","niveau":1,"author":"twistedlogix","author_id":"17445578","text":"@FoolzWizdom Are flu vaccines recommended? There's a school that opposes it saying it is better to build immunity naturally without flu vaccines. Asking generally not as a specific medical advice.","in_corpus":false,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":1,"subtree_size":3,"dt_root_h":1.747,"parent_id":"1876147567911674168","conversation_id":"1876147567911674168"},{"id":"1876203771170349439","x":0.069964,"y":7.0,"t":1736156811,"iso":"2025-01-06T09